1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-7767b3d4-a35f-4da2-96fa-cd0e2c265503\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">The Create New Tags in the Send or Schedule Page feature allows users to generate new contact tags on-the-fly while scheduling or sending email campaigns. Tags are used to segment contacts, trigger automations, and organize campaign recipients. Previously, tags had to be created in advance from the Contacts or Tags section, but now you can add them instantly during campaign setup, making the process faster and more intuitive.</p><h2 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-fd5a9d7b-2391-498d-a702-172a71896366\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Key Benefits of Adding Tags on the Send or Schedule Page</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-6985a9bb-38aa-4c37-8731-d7ea404652c2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Unlock greater efficiency and flexibility in your email marketing by using this feature:</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Instantly create and apply new tags without leaving the campaign workflow.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Eliminate the need to pre-plan or pre-create tags in the Contacts section.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Streamline automation setup by tagging contacts as you schedule or send emails.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Reduce context switching and save time during campaign creation.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Improve campaign organization and segmentation with real-time tag management.</li></ul><h2 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-fb1d1000-bc0d-4110-869b-4faf6d39b7ed\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">How To Add Tags in the Send or Schedule Page</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-9ccd5dd2-2025-49bd-bd29-8f8934aaac0c\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Setting up and using this feature is simple and ensures your campaigns are organized and automated efficiently. Follow these steps to create and apply new tags during the email campaign scheduling process:</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><u dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Step 1:&nbsp;</strong>Navigate to Email Marketing</u></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Under Email Campaigns, start a new email campaign or open an existing one you wish to edit.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><u style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Step 2:</strong> Proceed to the Send or Schedule</u></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Once you have finalized your email campaign, click on Send or Schedule to find the Add Tags option</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><img data-fr-image-pasted=\"true\" src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048795475/original/4bUfw8dOEtJ9s2k0VDJLiUrxITJpJdZJ1A1297.gif?1750774163\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155048795475\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><u dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Step 3:</strong> Enable the Automate option to Add Tags</u></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Click on <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Add Tags</strong> and toggle it to enable tag assignment. This allows you to add tags depending on the contact\u2019s interaction with the campaign</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><img data-fr-image-pasted=\"true\" src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048796255/original/_RaNDWhrLHBHrmyrCIZ1OhBqT1Va33ehjQ723e.gif?1750774658\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155048796255\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(232, 111, 37); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">IMPORTANT</span></strong>: If you wish to add a new tag which is not created previously in the CRM, just type in the New Tag Name. For example: I wish to add a tag called as \"Adit_test\", which is a new tag, hence I would be simply typing in \"Adit_test\" to add this new tag.</span>\n\n<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><img data-fr-image-pasted=\"true\" src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048796856/original/DJB6IOtv1q3wdYmZy4wCMeODo1kEWv36AQ913d.gif?1750775107\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155048796856\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\"></span></pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><u style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Step 4:</strong> View Tags in Stats</u></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">After sending, go to the \"Campaign Stats\" page and click \"Tags\" to see your tag summary.</p><h2 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-acc4effb-59f8-4734-a0c6-12351b7d8083\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Frequently Asked Questions</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-ebd6f411-ae41-4000-b07c-a42cec09d01d\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: Can I create multiple tags at once from the Send or Schedule page?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-1b83391c-da5d-41c8-9e4d-54bf1db5bd63\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Tags must be created one at a time by typing each new tag and clicking Add.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-6b867858-c477-48a7-a886-97bc616bd95d\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: Are new tags created here available for use in automations and workflows?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-7f3ec655-109b-41b2-ad38-ee10b7817dec\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Yes, any tag created from the Send or Schedule page is immediately available throughout your account.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-3ef45338-03f8-4750-86c3-1fcf60749241\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: Can I edit or delete a tag after creating it on the Send or Schedule page?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-76280951-65a3-4fda-84c9-9ad04b65a4f5\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Yes, you can manage all tags from the main Tags section in your account.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-1aa2d3fd-6642-4f57-86a5-d9a48a9f4b75\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: Will creating a new tag here affect existing contacts or automations?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-827af18c-ef41-4cf1-9d2c-98d24a22378c\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">No, new tags only apply to the campaign and contacts you assign them to; they will not retroactively affect existing automations.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-9a166161-e584-4b30-837c-2d44dc70e820\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: Is this feature available for all user roles?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-31380df2-2765-4d57-ac81-2d6cebc11750\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Access depends on your user permissions. Most marketing and admin roles can use this feature.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-5755cfb9-c6ae-4532-9a56-2183487e930e\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: Can I use this feature for SMS or other campaign types?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-dc2cca77-25b7-41e5-985d-e4ab5a791ac8\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Currently, this enhancement is specific to email campaigns.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001235961-auto-payments-in-recurring-templates", "title": "Auto Payments in Recurring Templates", "folder": "Getting Started w/ Payments", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48242859063/original/ITni0cQc1eUZ7DTw2wRWO4Yaa7guwqmH3g9710.png?1659534278", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48242640177/original/Ofz7DZ8pfpvGRMTZWek3tfVv1UJzoSu9qA9632.png?1659457401", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48245831218/original/1D6-aru93aKFHnuedU4CVieJX5PT17utCAed7b.png?1660737284", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48242640181/original/ZHrH2tOucpRTfouEBosgRkSJRrGgALK_tA9632.png?1659457401"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p>Introducing Auto Payments in Recurring Templates: A Streamlined Solution for Billing</p><p><br></p><p>Managing customer payments can be a daunting task, especially when it comes to recurring invoices. But worry no more! With the auto payment feature in our recurring templates, you can ensure timely payments without the hassle of waiting for your customers to take action.</p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">This innovative feature allows you to automatically deduct the invoice amount from your customer's credit card on the due date.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1679504104379\"><br></p><h4 class=\"fd-toc\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1679504098591\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Covered in this Article</span></strong></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1679504335023\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-does-auto-payment-in-a-recurring-template-mean?\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">What does auto payment in a recurring template mean?</span></strong></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1679504335623\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-automatically-charge-the-client?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">How to automatically charge the client?</span></a></strong></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1679504340071\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-does-Customer-Card-mean-here?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">What does Customer Card mean here?</span></a></strong></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1679504315887\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-will-I-get-notified-of-auto-payments?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">How will I get notified of auto payments?</span></a></strong></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1679504346417\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-happens-if-auto-payment-fails?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">What happens if auto-payment fails?</span></a></strong></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1679504359233\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-many-times-will-payment-be-retried-in-case-of-failure?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">How many times will payment be retried in case of failure?</span></a></strong></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1679504361663\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-does-automatically-charging-a-saved-card-mean?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">What does automatically charging a saved card mean?</span></a></strong></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1679504398952\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-does-automatically-charging-a-new-card-mean?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">What does automatically charging a new card mean?</span></a></strong></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1679504411080\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-end-auto-payments-on-a-recurring-template?\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">How to end auto-payments on a recurring template?</span></strong></a></h4><p class=\"tdfocus-1679504006384\"><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1679504194257\"><br></p><hr><h1 data-identifyelement=\"611\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-does-auto-payment-in-a-recurring-template-mean?\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"615\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">What does auto payment in a recurring template mean?</span></h1><p data-identifyelement=\"616\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"617\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Auto payments in recurring templates mean you don't have to wait for the customer to pay your invoice on time. The setting automatically deducts the invoice amount on the due date using the customer's credit card.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"618\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"619\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"620\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"621\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">The card which must be used to deduct the auto payments on the invoice due date can be defined as</span></p><ul data-identifyelement=\"622\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px; margin-left: 20px;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"623\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p data-identifyelement=\"624\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"625\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Customer card</span><span data-identifyelement=\"626\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;- Allows to automatically charge the customer on the same card used to make the first payment for the recurring template.</span></p></li><li data-identifyelement=\"627\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p data-identifyelement=\"628\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"629\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Saved card</span><span data-identifyelement=\"630\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;- If any saved cards exist for the end customer, locations can use that card to automatically charge the end customer on every due date for the recurring template.</span></p></li><li data-identifyelement=\"631\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p data-identifyelement=\"632\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"633\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">New Card</span><span data-identifyelement=\"634\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;- Locations can also enter new card details to charge the customer on that specific card whenever an invoice is due in the recurring template</span></p></li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"635\"><br data-identifyelement=\"636\"></p><h1 data-identifyelement=\"637\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-automatically-charge-the-client?\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"638\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">How to automatically charge the client?</span></h1><ul data-identifyelement=\"639\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"640\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"641\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Auto payments can be enabled on the recurring template while scheduling the template, as shown below.</span><br><br data-identifyelement=\"1062\"><span data-identifyelement=\"643\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48242859063/original/ITni0cQc1eUZ7DTw2wRWO4Yaa7guwqmH3g9710.png?1659534278\" style=\"width: 501px;\" class=\"fr-dib fr-fil\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48242859063\" data-identifyelement=\"644\"></span></li></ul><h1 data-identifyelement=\"646\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-does-Customer-Card-mean-here?\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"647\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">What does Customer Card mean here?</span></h1><p data-identifyelement=\"648\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1063\"><span data-identifyelement=\"649\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">This option allows location users to charge the end customer from the card the customer uses to make the first payment in the recurring template. This will become applicable from the immediate next occurrence of the invoice irrespective of the invoice which is paid (can be the first, second, or n-th invoice)</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"650\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"651\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"652\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"653\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">For reference, if the customer makes the payment for the first time on the 4th invoice without paying the first three invoices, then auto-payment using that card would start from the 5th occurrence of the recurring template(if it exists)</span><br data-identifyelement=\"1064\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1065\"></p><h1 data-identifyelement=\"654\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-will-I-get-notified-of-auto-payments?\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"655\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">How will I get notified of auto payments?</span></h1><p data-identifyelement=\"1066\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1067\"></p><ul data-identifyelement=\"656\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"657\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"658\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Notification will be sent to the location user and the end customer upon every success/failure instance of a child invoice in the recurring template.</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"659\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p data-identifyelement=\"660\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"661\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">The end customer will also be notified before deducting the charge automatically. This notification will be sent \"x\" days in advance, defined in the recurring setting frequency.</span></p></li><li data-identifyelement=\"662\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p data-identifyelement=\"663\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"664\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">The payment will not be processed automatically if any child invoice is updated before deducting the auto-charge. The location user would be informed of the same via mail, and they should share the updated invoice with the end customer to avoid any lost recurring revenue.</span></p></li></ul><div align=\"left\" data-identifyelement=\"665\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left:0pt;\"><table data-identifyelement=\"666\" style=\"border: none; border-collapse: collapse; margin-left: 20px;\"><colgroup data-identifyelement=\"667\"><col width=\"261\" data-identifyelement=\"668\"><col width=\"161\" data-identifyelement=\"669\"></colgroup><tbody data-identifyelement=\"670\"><tr data-identifyelement=\"671\" style=\"height:38.5pt;\"><td data-identifyelement=\"672\" style=\"padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-iden