r\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"709\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Auto-payment information</span></p></td><td data-identifyelement=\"710\" style=\"padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-identifyelement=\"711\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"712\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Receiver</span></p></td></tr><tr data-identifyelement=\"713\" style=\"height:25pt;\"><td data-identifyelement=\"714\" style=\"padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-identifyelement=\"715\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"716\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Child invoice updated</span></p></td><td data-identifyelement=\"717\" style=\"padding: 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-identifyelement=\"718\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"719\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Receiver</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1 data-identifyelement=\"720\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-happens-if-auto-payment-fails?\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1068\"><span data-identifyelement=\"721\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">What happens if auto-payment fails?</span></h1><ul data-identifyelement=\"722\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"723\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"724\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">In case of auto-payment failure from the defined card, the end customer and invoice sender would be notified via mail.</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"725\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p data-identifyelement=\"726\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"727\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Suppose the end customer successfully pays via the same card or a new card upon notification. In that case, the new card will be updated to deduct auto-payment for all future occurrences.</span></p></li><li data-identifyelement=\"728\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p data-identifyelement=\"729\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"730\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Else the payment would be retried two more times, after 24 hours gap of each try, for attempting to process the payment for the invoice. If the payment has not been processed, no further attempt would be made for this instance automatically, and the customer would be required to pay the invoice manually.</span></p></li></ul><h1 data-identifyelement=\"731\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-many-times-will-payment-be-retried-in-case-of-failure?\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"732\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">How many times will payment be retried in case of failure?</span></h1><p data-identifyelement=\"733\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"734\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">In case of failure in deducting the charge automatically from the defined card, two auto retry attempts would be made after 24 hrs each from the first failure. If the payment is still not processed, the end customer must pay manually for the invoice.to pay for the invoice manually</span></p><h1 data-identifyelement=\"735\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-does-automatically-charging-a-saved-card-mean?\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"736\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">What does automatically charging a saved card mean?</span></h1><p data-identifyelement=\"737\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"738\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">This option allows location users to charge the end customer using one of the saved cards with the location user. Starting from the first occurrence, this would deduct the invoice amount from the selected saved card starting from the first occurrence.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"739\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"740\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Any failure to charge the amount from the saved card would notify the location user and the end customer. The saved card is not authorized while scheduling the template.</span></p><h1 data-identifyelement=\"741\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-does-automatically-charging-a-new-card-mean?\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"742\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">What does automatically charging a new card mean?</span></h1><p data-identifyelement=\"743\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"744\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">This option allows location users to charge the end customer using new card details entered by the location user. Starting from the first occurrence, this would deduct the invoice amount from the desired card.</span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1679503971743\" data-identifyelement=\"745\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1679503967286\" data-identifyelement=\"746\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Any failure to charge the amount from the selected card would notify the location user and the end customer. Any new card selected would be authorized with the minimum charge amount in the respective currency while scheduling the template.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"747\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"748\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Any card successfully added will also be saved for future purposes for the location user.</span></p><h1 data-identifyelement=\"749\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-end-auto-payments-on-a-recurring-template?\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1679503974695\" data-identifyelement=\"750\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">How to end auto-payments on a recurring template?</span></h1><p data-identifyelement=\"751\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"752\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Auto-payments can be ended on an ongoing recurring template by selecting the Manage Auto-payments option from the invoice builder, as shown below.</span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1679503783022\" data-identifyelement=\"753\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"754\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"755\" style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:605px;height:381px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48242640177/original/Ofz7DZ8pfpvGRMTZWek3tfVv1UJzoSu9qA9632.png?1659457401\" width=\"605\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48242640177\" data-identifyelement=\"756\" style=\"width: 511px; height: 327.212px;\"></span></span><br data-identifyelement=\"757\"><br data-identifyelement=\"758\">This will open the Auto-payment scheduling modal with the toggle turned ON and the payment option selected. The location user can turn the toggle off to disable auto-payments from the next occurrence<span data-identifyelement=\"759\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1069\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1070\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1679503984791\" data-identifyelement=\"1071\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48245831218/original/1D6-aru93aKFHnuedU4CVieJX5PT17utCAed7b.png?1660737284\" style=\"width: 522px;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48245831218\" data-identifyelement=\"760\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"761\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1072\"><span data-identifyelement=\"762\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Can I turn on auto payments in an ongoing recurring template?</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"763\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"764\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Yes, auto-payments can be turned ON on an ongoing recurring template using the manage auto-payments option in the builder.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"765\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1679503992799\" data-identifyelement=\"766\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"767\" style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:607px;height:382px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48242640181/original/ZHrH2tOucpRTfouEBosgRkSJRrGgALK_tA9632.png?1659457401\" width=\"607\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48242640181\" data-identifyelement=\"768\" style=\"width: 541px; height: 346.168px;\"></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"769\"><br data-identifyelement=\"770\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"773\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 20px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"774\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">This will open the auto-payment modal with the toggle turned off. The location user can turn the toggle on and select the desired payment option from the customer, saved or new card.</span></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006425-improve-your-phone-number-s-reputation-with-voice-integrity", "title": "Improve your Phone Number&#39;s reputation with Voice Integrity", "folder": "LeadConnector Phone", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054639949/original/Aa9C7Qf1qIZvTsLWvHNpdHA0mFidBOZjFgace5.png?1758870604", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054639972/original/gBBsZHE4WskC4q6nTDAAOhNERXt8Tg_1Pwafcd.png?1758870629"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-end=\"418\" data-start=\"63\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">In this guide, you\u2019ll learn how to register your U.S. phone numbers with leadconnector's Voice Integrity feature\u2014leveraging top caller-ID analytics platforms to clear spam flags, repair your caller-ID reputation, and significantly boost your answer rates.<br><br></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#Voice-Integrity-with-Lead-Connector\">Voice Integrity with Lead Connector</a></li><li><a href=\"#Why-Switch-on-Voice-Integrity?\">Why Switch on Voice Integrity?</a></li><li><a href=\"#Before-Registering-for-Voice-Integrity%C2%A0\">Before Registering for Voice Integrity&nbsp;</a></li><li><a href=\"#Enabling-Voice-Integrity\">Enabling Voice Integrity</a><ul><li><a href=\"#Step-1%3A-Navigate-to-the-Voice-Integrity-Tab-within-the-Trust-Center%C2%A0\">Step 1: Navigate to the Voice Integrity Tab within the Trust Center&nbsp;</a></li><li><a href=\"#Step-2%3A-Complete-the-Registration-Form\">Step 2: Complete the Registration Form</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#What-Happens-After-You-Register?\">What Happens After You Register?</a></li><li><a href=\"#Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Voice-Integrity-with-Lead-Connector\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Voice Integrity with Lead Connector</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-end=\"418\" data-start=\"63\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Legitimate calls shouldn\u2019t be mistaken for spam. With l<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">eadconnector</span>\u2019s Voice Integrity, you can register your U.S. phone numbers with the leading caller-ID analytics firms (First Orion, Hiya, TNS) to remove \u201cspam likely\u201d labels, repair a troubled reputation, and boost your answer rates, especially for numbers that have been blocked or flagged in the past.<br><br></p><h2 data-end=\"461\" data-start=\"425\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Why-Switch-on-Voice-Integrity?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Why Switch on Voice Integrity?</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul data-end=\"810\" data-start=\"463\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"555\" data-start=\"463\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"555\" data-start=\"465\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"490\" data-start=\"465\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Fix a bad reputation:</strong> Clear existing spam flags and restore trust in your caller ID.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></li><li data-end=\"679\" data-start=\"556\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"679\" data-start=\"558\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"582\" data-start=\"558\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Higher answer rates:</strong> Studies show calls labeled with a recognized, branded name are far more likely to be answered.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></li><li data-end=\"810\" data-start=\"680\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"810\" data-start=\"682\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"708\" data-start=\"682\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Better deliverability:</strong> Legitimate callers avoid unnecessary blocks, so your outreach and support calls reach more customers.</p></li></ul><h2 data-end=\"852\" data-start=\"817\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Before-Registering-for-Voice-Integrity&nbsp;\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Before Registering for Voice Integrity</strong><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Before you enable Voice Integrity, make sure you\u2019ve met the following key requirements.</p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ol data-end=\"1286\" data-start=\"854\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"1006\" data-start=\"854\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1006\" data-start=\"857\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"885\" data-start=\"857\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">SHAKEN/STIR Registration</strong> (required)<br data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"899\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">To prove each outgoing call is authentic, you must have a valid SHAKEN/STIR attestation on your account.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></li><li data-end=\"1148\" data-start=\"1007\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1148\" data-start=\"1010\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"1032\" data-start=\"1010\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">CNAM (Caller Name)</strong> (recommended)<br data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1049\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Submitting a branded name alongside your number further enhances trust in analytics platforms.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></li><li data-end=\"1286\" data-start=\"1149\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1286\" data-start=\"1152\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"1179\" data-start=\"1152\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">U.S. Phone Numbers Only</strong><br data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1182\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Voice Integrity currently applies solely to domestic traffic\u2014international numbers are not supported.</p></li></ol><h2 data-end=\"1337\" data-start=\"1293\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Enabling-Voice-Integrity\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Enabling Voice Integrity</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Here\u2019s how to activate Voice Integrity in minutes and ensure your calls are marked as legitimate across the major networks. Also, please note that SHAKEN/STIR registration is required to complete the Voice Integrity form. If you don\u2019t already have it, register before proceeding.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 data-end=\"1702\" data-start=\"1507\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Step-1:-Navigate-to-the-Voice-Integrity-Tab-within-the-Trust-Center&nbsp;\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-