t;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-end=\"3219\" data-start=\"3011\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-end=\"3039\" data-start=\"3011\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: Why is CNAM optional?</span></strong><br data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3042\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">SHAKEN/STIR is the core requirement for proving call authenticity. Adding a branded CNAM record is recommended to maximize trust and answer rates, but not strictly mandatory.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000005226-messaging-setup-troubleshoot", "title": "Messaging setup &amp; troubleshoot", "folder": "Facebook", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046611201/original/560dNU3lKrXB3ADHgcxA9uUfY8O2B6oMvw0343.png?1747220054", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046618449/original/jD5YyOakvOAc3JTp5SfO-NdLt6qeSc-1vQ9dfe.png?1747225602", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046618680/original/fXU2j4i8_yMPm5b_vp4sgqbteIBBnFBnIw4712.png?1747225743", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046618711/original/Kw8mxcMbUAe45MoZsidRgdE5GNORLGLDdg635f.png?1747225761", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046611201/original/560dNU3lKrXB3ADHgcxA9uUfY8O2B6oMvw0343.png?1747220054", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.fr