le=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 400;\">1. Leadconnector should have access to send message and access message for the page (<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/settings?tab=business_tools&amp;ref=settings\">https://www.facebook.com/settings?tab=business_tools&amp;ref=settings</a>)</span></p><h1 data-identifyelement=\"842\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-size: 2em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046611201/original/560dNU3lKrXB3ADHgcxA9uUfY8O2B6oMvw0343.png?1747220054\" style=\"width: 658px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155046611201\"></h1><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">2. User account should have full access to page and should have message access. ( Link: <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://business.facebook.com/latest/settings\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(39, 83, 215); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\">https://business.facebook.com/latest/settings</a>)<br><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046618449/original/jD5YyOakvOAc3JTp5SfO-NdLt6qeSc-1vQ9dfe.png?1747225602\" style=\"width: 662px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155046618449\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">3. FB messenger should be enabled in Settings &gt;&gt; Integration &gt;&gt; Facebook card &gt;&gt; Settings</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046618680/original/fXU2j4i8_yMPm5b_vp4sgqbteIBBnFBnIw4712.png?1747225743\" style=\"width: 662px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155046618680\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046618711/original/Kw8mxcMbUAe45MoZsidRgdE5GNORLGLDdg635f.png?1747225761\" style=\"width: 656px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155046618711\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h1 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Instagram-Messaging-setup:\"><br>Instagram Messaging setup:</h1><p dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"508\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">1. Leadconnector should have access to send message and access message for the page (<a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://business.facebook.com/latest/settings\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(39, 83, 215); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\"></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/settings?tab=business_tools&amp;ref=settings\">https://www.facebook.com/settings?tab=business_tools&amp;ref=settings</a>)</span></p><h1 data-identifyelement=\"842\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"-1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-size: 2em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046611201/original/560dNU3lKrXB3ADHgcxA9uUfY8O2B6oMvw0343.png?1747220054\" style=\"width: 658px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155046611201\"></h1><p dir=\"ltr\">2. Verify that you have access to send and receive message on instagram under instagram accounts ( <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://business.facebook.com/latest/settings\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(39, 83, 215); user-select: auto; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: start; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\">https://business.facebook.com/latest/settings</a>)</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046820921/original/tLINkNzirrxoXfTSJdGxULjH4cx8k9f3Ug4084.png?1747628845\" style=\"width: 662px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155046820921\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\">3. Verify instagram account is present in connected assets list in the page connected.</p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046820913/original/rThbgLELyFW3QsFfS1WTuVteuNKAyl2-ag42d1.png?1747628832\" style=\"width: 661px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155046820913\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">4. Instagram messaging is enabled in Settings &gt;&gt; Integration &gt;&gt; Facebook card &gt;&gt; Settings<br><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046820968/original/rYafkZPj6wQIXvvuNGOOqY4P2wQWSO_S0Q7cbb.png?1747629000\" style=\"width: 662px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155046820968\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\">5. Also, confirm if connected tools have access over instagram messages. The below setting needs to be checked over instagram app:</p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">Login to Instagram App</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Go to settings and activity.&nbsp;</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Under Messages and Story reply, go to messages request.&nbsp;</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Allow access to connected tools</li></ul><p></p><h1 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Other-facebook/instagram-related-support-guides:\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055401480/original/IPf2dRiFxB_MuBgAJPE9_WJ0DiK2QkbpzQe0dc.png?1759832858\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155055401480\">Other facebook/instagram related support guides:</h1><ul><li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><a href=\"155000005224-facebook-form-field-mapping.html\">Facebook Form mapping</a></span></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><a href=\"155000005225-facebook-multi-page-setup-guide.html\"></a><a href=\"155000005225-facebook-multi-page-setup-guide.html\">Facebook multi page&nbsp;Setup</a></span></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><a href=\"155000005228-page-selection-guide.html\">Facebook Page selection guide</a></span></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><a href=\"155000005240-facebook-multi-page-troubleshoot.html\"></a><a href=\"155000005240-facebook-multi-page-troubleshoot.html\">Facebook Multi page troubleshoot</a></span></li></ul><p><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000003323-history-for-gpt-actions-ai-memory-key-", "title": "History for GPT actions (AI Memory Key)", "folder": "Workflow", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032371718/original/tI783TSLoilwJ_QPlNIVJIK1pBT5fEcqbQ7ba5.png?1725601460", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032371716/original/XAdYXXBEBTsOZdU0gVw-fYJv6oQQn3V9FQ7ba5.jpg?1725601460", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032371717/original/A5zs-yjkchalOife_XPuxYvkVxeYDchb1Q7ba5.jpg?1725601460", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032371719/original/TKLXeL6FEoE_yWA5z8fVXl9j4pnlT8nt0Q7ba5.png?1725601460"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Introducing History for GPT actions..!!</strong></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"fd-toc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: 