uot;;\">Extract the alphanumeric value from the URL.<br data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1553\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong data-end=\"1567\" data-start=\"1555\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Example:</strong> In this case, this is the account ID:<br data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1608\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><code data-end=\"1644\" data-start=\"1610\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 1em; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">0d2031c4bcda5980204101c44294740c<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046014674/original/jY9PPmE5Kti3UkFd87sFH46emvGJzqLtTg54ad.jpg?1746181626\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155046014674\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></code></span></span></p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1649\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; height: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; clear: both; user-select: none; break-after: page; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><h2 data-end=\"1666\" data-start=\"1651\" id=\"Transfer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong data-end=\"1666\" data-start=\"1654\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Transfer</strong></span></span></h2><p data-end=\"1843\" data-start=\"1667\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Once all 2 steps above are completed, we will initiate the transfer process from our end. You can expect the transfer to get completed within <strong data-end=\"1821\" data-start=\"1809\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">24 hours</strong> after we initiate it. Then you need to approve the transfer by following these steps:</span></span></p><p data-end=\"1958\" data-start=\"1845\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"1958\" data-start=\"1845\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Go to 'Manage Domains' under 'Domain Registration' in the left navigation menu and click on 'Manage' button for the given domain.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046176463/original/eg_qe7JZrPhL5QRw2qRWnieAISySpi-SjQ56cd.png?1746528227\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155046176463\"></span></span></li><li data-end=\"1958\" data-start=\"1845\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Accept the transfer request.&nbsp;<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046110498/original/9w5CUTY7e1aRJH_nN1Axvi7o1npiKF7oKwf12a.png?1746442019\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155046110498\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: 606px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></span></span></li><li data-end=\"1958\" data-start=\"1845\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">You can expect the transfer to get completed within 24 hours after you accept it. Once transfer is successful, status will turn to 'Active' for that domain under 'Manage Domains'. If you find 'Invalid Nameserver' status in 'Account Home' for that domain, please wait for a few hours and then check again.</span><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046110500/original/5WtpI9h_w9sTo3givdSn58Kw028kOw7dxgf12a.jpg?1746442019\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155046110500\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: 578px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></span></li></ul><hr style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><h2 data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"2021\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\u26a0\ufe0f-Final-Note:-\u201cInvalid-Nameservers\u201d-Status\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">\u26a0\ufe0f Note: \u201cInvalid Nameservers\u201d Status</span></h2><p><br></p><p data-end=\"2197\" data-start=\"2069\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">After the transfer has been accepted, the domain may temporarily show <strong data-end=\"2164\" data-start=\"2139\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">\u201cInvalid Nameservers\u201d</strong> in the <strong data-end=\"2188\" data-start=\"2172\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Account Home</strong> section <strong data-end=\"2216\" data-start=\"2201\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Don\u2019t worry</strong> - this is expected behavior.</span></p><p data-end=\"2370\" data-start=\"2247\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">This warning typically resolves itself <strong data-end=\"2319\" data-start=\"2286\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">automatically within 24 hours</strong> post-transfer. No action is needed from your side.</span></p><hr>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006339-gain-a-competitive-edge-with-competitor-analysis-in-reputation-management", "title": "? What is Competitor Analysis in Reputation Management?", "folder": "Review Management", "images": [], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-end=\"735\" data-start=\"390\" dir=\"ltr\">The Competitor Analysis feature empowers agencies and businesses to benchmark their online reputation against up to three competitors. Using real-time review data from Google, Facebook, Yelp, Foursquare, Trustpilot, and more, you can quickly uncover strengths, weaknesses, and opportunities to get ahead of the competition.</p><hr data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"740\"><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#%F0%9F%93%91-Table-of-Contents\">? Table of Contents</a></li><li><a href=\"#%F0%9F%94%8E-What-is-Competitor-Analysis-in-Reputation-Management?\">? What is Competitor Analysis in Reputation Management?</a></li><li><a href=\"#%F0%9F%8C%9F-Key-Benefits-of-Competitor-Analysis\">? Key Benefits of Competitor Analysis</a></li><li><a href=\"#%E2%9A%99%EF%B8%8F-How-To-Setup-Competitor-Analysis\">\u2699\ufe0f How To Setup Competitor Analysis</a><ul><li><a href=\"#Step-1%3A-Navigate-to-Competitor-Analysis\">Step 1: Navigate to Competitor Analysis</a></li><li><a href=\"#Step-2%3A-Add-Your-Business\">Step 2: Add Your Business</a></li><li><a href=\"#Step-3%3A-Add-Competitors\">Step 3: Add Competitors</a></li><li><a href=\"#Step-4%3A-Check-Ratings-by-Source\">Step 4: Check Ratings by Source</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#%F0%9F%93%8A-Additional-Competitor-Analysis-Subtopics\">? Additional Competitor Analysis Subtopics</a><ul><li><a href=\"#Real-Time-Benchmarking\">Real-Time Benchmarking</a></li><li><a href=\"#Multi-Platform-Insights\">Multi-Platform Insights</a></li><li><a href=\"#Interactive-Visuals%3A-Sentiment-Heatmap-&amp;-Positioning-Grid\">Interactive Visuals: Sentiment Heatmap &amp; Positioning Grid</a></li><li><a href=\"#Easy-Setup-and-Automation\">Easy Setup and Automation</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#%E2%9D%93-Frequently-Asked-Questions\">\u2753 Frequently Asked Questions</a></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1537\"><h2 data-end=\"1600\" data-start=\"1539\" id=\"?-What-is-Competitor-Analysis-in-Reputation-Management?\">? What is Competitor Analysis in Reputation Management?</h2><p data-end=\"1791\" data-start=\"1602\" dir=\"ltr\">Competitor Analysis is a powerful tool within the CRM's Reputation Management suite that allows agencies to compare their online reputation metrics with up to three competitors.</p><p data-end=\"1961\" data-start=\"1793\">By automatically gathering and analyzing review data across platforms like Google, Facebook, Yelp, Foursquare, Trustpilot, and more, Competitor Analysis provides:</p><ul data-end=\"2535\" data-start=\"1963\"><li data-end=\"2059\" data-start=\"1963\"><p data-end=\"2059\" data-start=\"1965\"><strong data-end=\"1993\" data-start=\"1965\">Reputation Score (0\u2013100)</strong> \u2013 Weighted rating based on reviews, volume, and responsiveness.</p></li><li data-end=\"2166\" data-start=\"2060\"><p data-end=\"2166\" data-start=\"2062\"><strong data-end=\"2083\" data-start=\"2062\">Sentiment Heatmap</strong> \u2013 A visual matrix of positive, neutral, and negative reviews across competitors.</p></li><li data-end=\"2283\" data-start=\"2167\"><p data-end=\"2283\" data-start=\"2169\"><strong data-end=\"2197\" data-start=\"2169\">Keyword &amp; Theme Analysis</strong> \u2013 Trending positives and pain points, with clickable themes to view actual reviews.</p></li><li data-end=\"2417\" data-start=\"2284\"><p data-end=\"2417\" data-start=\"2286\"><strong data-end=\"2317\" data-start=\"2286\">Competitor Positioning Grid</strong> \u2013 Interactive quadrant mapping strengths vs. weaknesses to reveal what customers love or dislike.</p></li><li data-end=\"2535\" data-start=\"2418\"><p data-end=\"2535\" data-start=\"2420\"><strong data-end=\"2441\" data-start=\"2420\">Ratings by Source</strong> \u2013 Platform-specific insights (average rating, total reviews, response time, response rate).</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2540\"><h2 data-end=\"2585\" data-start=\"2542\" id=\"?-Key-Benefits-of-Competitor-Analysis\">? Key Benefits of Competitor Analysis</h2><ul data-end=\"3364\" data-start=\"2587\"><li data-end=\"2690\" data-start=\"2587\"><p data-end=\"2690\" data-start=\"2589\"><strong data-end=\"2615\" data-start=\"2589\">Real-Time Benchmarking</strong> \u2013 Instantly compare star ratings, review volumes, and response behavior.</p></li><li data-end=\"2791\" data-start=\"2691\"><p data-end=\"2791\" data-start=\"2693\"><strong data-end=\"2720\" data-start=\"2693\">Multi-Platform Insights</strong> \u2013 Access data from multiple review sites for a holistic perspective.</p></li><li data-end=\"2889\" data-start=\"2792\"><p data-end=\"2889\" data-start=\"2794\"><strong data-end=\"2816\" data-start=\"2794\">Actionable Visuals</strong> \u2013 Sentiment heatmaps and positioning grids highlight performance gaps.</p></li><li data-end=\"3004\" data-start=\"2890\"><p data-end=\"3004\" data-start=\"2892\"><strong data-end=\"2919\" data-start=\"2892\">Interactive Drill-Downs</strong> \u2013 Click theme words or sentiment blocks to see the exact reviews driving insights.</p></li><li data-end=\"3093\" data-start=\"3005\"><p data-end=\"3093\" data-start=\"3007\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-end=\"3027\" data-start=\"3007\">Effortless Setup</strong> \u2013 Simply add competitors and let your CRM auto-fetch the data.</p></li><li data-end=\"3173\" data-start=\"3094\"><p data-end=\"3173\" data-start=\"3096\"><strong data-end=\"3118\" data-start=\"3096\">Enhanced Reporting</strong> \u2013 Share competitor insights in client presentations.</p></li><li data-end=\"3258\" data-start=\"3174\"><p data-end=\"3258\" data-start=\"3176\"><strong data-end=\"3192\" data-start=\"3176\">Time Savings</strong> \u2013 Eliminate manual research and streamline reputation tracking.</p></li><li data-end=\"3364\" data-start=\"3259\"><p data-end=\"3364\" data-start=\"3261\"><strong data-end=\"3290\" data-start=\"3261\">Strategic Decision-Making</strong> \u2013 Use data-backed insights to refine strategies and boost market share.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3369\"><h2 data-end=\"3411\" data-start=\"3371\" id=\"\u2699\ufe0f-How-To-Setup-Competitor-Analysis\">\u2699\ufe0f How To Setup Competitor Analysis</h2><h3 data-end=\"3458\" data-start=\"3413\" id=\"Step-1:-Navigate-to-Competitor-Analysis\">Step 1: Navigate to Competitor Analysis</h3><ul data-end=\"3549\" data-start=\"3459\"><li data-end=\"3505\" data-start=\"3459\"><p data-end=\"3505\" data-start=\"3461\">From your dashboard, click <strong data-end=\"3502\" data-start=\"3488\">Reputation</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"3549\" data-start=\"3506\"><p data-end=\"3549\" data-start=\"3508\">Select the <strong data-end=\"3542\" data-start=\"3519\">Competitor Analysis</strong> tab.</p></li></ul><h3 data-end=\"3582\" data-start=\"3551\" id=\"Step-2:-Add-Your-Business\">Step 2: Add Your Business</h3><ul data-end=\"3760\" data-start=\"3583\"><li data-end=\"3617\" data-start=\"3583\"><p data-end=\"3617\" data-start=\"3585\">Click <strong data-end=\"3614\" data-start=\"3591\">+ Add Your Business</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"3677\" data-start=\"3618\"><p data-end=\"3677\" data-start=\"3620\">Allow location permission and search for your business.</p></li><li data-end=\"3760\" data-start=\"3678\"><p data-end=\"3760\" data-start=\"3680\">Select the correct listing and click <strong data-end=\"3740\" data-start=\"3717\">+ Add Your Business</strong> again to confirm.</p></li></ul><h3 data-end=\"3791\" data-start=\"3762\" id=\"Step-3:-Add-Competitors\">Step 3: Add Competitors</h3><ul data-end=\"3959\" data-start=\"3792\"><li data-end=\"3850\" data-start=\"3792\"><p data-end=\"3850\" data-start=\"3794\">Click <strong data-end=\"3820\" data-start=\"3800\">+ Add Competitor</strong> (maximum of 3 competitors).</p></li><li data-end=\"3916\" data-start=\"3851\"><p data-end=\"3916\" data-start=\"3853\">Search for competitor businesses and select the correct ones.</p></li><li data-end=\"3959\" data-start=\"3917\"><p data-end=\"3959\" data-start=\"3919\">Click <strong data-end=\"3945\" data-start=\"3925\">+ Add Competitor</strong> to confirm.</p></li></ul><h3 data-end=\"3998\" data-start=\"3961\" id=\"Step-4:-Check-Ratings-by-Source\">Step 4: Check Ratings by Source</h3><ul data-end=\"4289\" data-start=\"3999\"><li data-end=\"4078\" data-start=\"3999\"><p data-end=\"4078\" data-start=\"4001\">Scroll to <strong data-end=\"4032\" data-start=\"4011\">Ratings by Source</strong> (Google, Facebook, Yelp, Trustpilot, etc.).</p></li><li data-end=\"4289\" data-start=\"4079\"><p data-end=\"4107\" data-start=\"4081\">For each platform, view:</p><ul data-end=\"4289\" data-start=\"4110\"><li data-end=\"4147\" data-start=\"4110\"><p data-end=\"4147\" data-start=\"4112\"><strong data-end=\"4130\" data-start=\"4112\">Average Rating</strong> (e.g., 4.9 \u2b50\ufe0f)</p></li><li data-end=\"4183\" data-start=\"4150\"><p data-end=\"4183\" data-start=\"4152\"><strong data-end=\"4169\" data-start=\"4152\">Total Reviews</strong> (e.g., 295)</p></li><li data-end=\"4237\" data-start=\"4186\"><p data-end=\"4237\" data-start=\"4188\"><strong data-end=\"4213\" data-start=\"4188\">Average Response Time</strong> (e.g., N/A or 2 days)</p></li><li data-end=\"4289\" data-start=\"4240\"><p data-end=\"4289\" data-start=\"4242\"><strong data-end=\"4259\" data-start=\"4242\">Response Rate</strong> (% of reviews responded to)</p></li></ul></li></ul><hr data-start=\"4291\" data-end=\"4294\"><h2 data-end=\"4344\" data-start=\"4296\" id=\"?-Additional-Competitor-Analysis-Subtopics\">? Additional Competitor Analysis Subtopics</h2><h3 data-end=\"4374\" data-start=\"4346\" id=\"Real-Time-Benchmarking\">Real-Time Benchmarking</h3><ul data-end=\"4487\" data-start=\"4375\"><li data-end=\"4432\" data-start=\"4375\"><p data-end=\"4432\" data-start=\"4377\">Compare star ratings and review volumes side-by-side.</p></li><li data-end=\"4487\" data-start=\"4433\"><p data-end=\"4487\" data-start=\"4435\">Monitor average response times and responsiveness.</p></li></ul><h3 data-end=\"4518\" data-start=\"4489\" id=\"Multi-Platform-Insights\">Multi-Platform Insights</h3><ul data-end=\"4666\" data-start=\"4519\"><li data-end=\"4602\" data-start=\"4519\"><p data-end=\"4602\" data-start=\"4521\">Expand beyond Google to see competitor performance on other major review sites.</p></li><li data-end=\"4666\" data-start=\"4603\"><p data-end=\"4666\" data-start=\"4605\">Identify platforms where competitors excel (or fall short).</p></li></ul><h3 data-end=\"4731\" data-start=\"4668\" id=\"Interactive-Visuals:-Sentiment-Heatmap-&amp;-Positioning-Grid\">Interactive Visuals: Sentiment Heatmap &amp; Positioning Grid</h3><ul data-end=\"5027\" data-start=\"4732\"><li data-end=\"4862\" data-start=\"4732\"><p data-end=\"4862\" data-start=\"4734\"><strong data-end=\"4755\" data-start=\"4734\">Sentiment Heatmap</strong> \u2013 View positive, neutral, and negative review distribution. <em data-end=\"4860\" data-start=\"4816\">Click any block to see the actual reviews.</em></p></li><li data-end=\"5027\" data-start=\"4863\"><p data-end=\"5027\" data-start=\"4865\"><strong data-end=\"4885\" data-start=\"4865\">Positioning Grid</strong> \u2013 Explore strengths and weaknesses through sentiment-tagged keywords. <em data-end=\"5025\" data-start=\"4956\">Click themes to reveal reviews linked to each strength or weakness.</em></p></li></ul><h3 data-end=\"5060\" data-start=\"5029\" id=\"Easy-Setup-and-Automation\">Easy Setup and Automation</h3><ul data-end=\"5198\" data-start=\"5061\"><li data-end=\"5121\" data-start=\"5061\"><p data-end=\"5121\" data-start=\"5063\">Competitor data is auto-fetched and refreshed regularly.</p></li><li data-end=\"5198\" data-start=\"5122\"><p data-end=\"5198\" data-start=\"5124\">No manual entry required \u2014 once set up, the system continuously updates.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"5200\" data-end=\"5203\"><h2 data-end=\"5238\" data-start=\"5205\" id=\"\u2753-Frequently-Asked-Questions\">\u2753 Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p data-end=\"5359\" data-start=\"5240\"><strong data-end=\"5290\" data-start=\"5240\">Q: How many competitors can I compare at once?</strong><br data-start=\"5290\" data-end=\"5293\">You can benchmark against up to <strong data-end=\"5346\" data-start=\"5325\">three competitors</strong> at a time.</p><p data-end=\"5484\" data-start=\"5361\"><strong data-end=\"5405\" data-start=\"5361\">Q: Which review platforms are supported?</strong><br data-start=\"5405\" data-end=\"5408\">Google, Facebook, Yelp, Foursquare, Trustpilot, and other major platforms.</p><p data-end=\"5600\" data-start=\"5486\"><strong data-end=\"5519\" data-start=\"5486\">Q: How often is data updated?</strong><br data-start=\"5519\" data-end=\"5522\">Data is auto-fetched and refreshed regularly to provide the latest insights.</p><p data-end=\"5707\" data-start=\"5602\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-end=\"5639\" data-start=\"5602\">Q: Is manual data entry required?</strong><br data-start=\"5639\" data-end=\"5642\">No, all competitor data is automatically gathered.</p><p data-end=\"5816\" data-start=\"5709\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-end=\"5753\" data-start=\"5709\">Q: Can I change competitors after setup?</strong><br data-start=\"5753\" data-end=\"5756\">Yes, you can edit or update competitor selections anytime.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000000193-how-to-set-up-the-client-portal-", "title": "The page you were looking for doesn't exist.", "folder": "", "images": [], "videos": [], "content": ""}, {"slug": "155000003318-cancellation-reschedule-policy-booking-widget-", "title": "Cancellation &amp; Reschedule Policy (Booking Widget)", "folder": "Calendars", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155028625131/original/0TvqsG7WFWE38W57-V7_SYeTbHlb2Mb0sw2d32.png?1719998846", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155028625424/original/1V8czujWDowzgUZ5td26xTEZrBiMjZ9vTQ16ec.png?1719999048", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155028626656/original/zXnX_zWHfeFSujbXsJo_pLkf7ip-kwMigQ8405.png?1719999815"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#Overview\">Overview</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-to-use?\">How to use?</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-do-bookers-receive-the-cancellation-&amp;-reschedule-link?\">How do bookers receive the cancellation &amp; reschedule link?</a></li></ul><hr><h3 id=\"Overview\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Overview</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\">The Cancellation &amp; Reschedule Policy setting allows you to define the time frame during which bookers can access the cancellation or reschedule link on the booking widget.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">This feature helps you set a window after which bookers cannot access the cancellation or reschedule link to make changes to their appointments. Instead, they will need to contact the business owner for any modifications. This primarily helps businesses avoid last-minute changes to their appointments.</p><hr><h3 id=\"How-to-use?\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">How to use?</strong></h3><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">Navigate to Calendar Settings and select the desired calendar.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Head to the Notifications and Additional Options section.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Under Cancellation and Reschedule Policy, turn on \"Allow Cancellation of Meeting\" and \"Allow Rescheduling of Meeting\".</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155028625131/original/0TvqsG7WFWE38W57-V7_SYeTbHlb2Mb0sw2d32.png?1719998846\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155028625131\"></p><p><br></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">Specify the time range after which the links should be disabled. (Note: Keeping the value blank means the link will never expire and the booker can access it anytime.)</li></ul><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155028625424/original/1V8czujWDowzgUZ5td26xTEZrBiMjZ9vTQ16ec.png?1719999048\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155028625424\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">When this setting is enabled:</strong></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">A cancellation and a rescheduling link will be added to the additional notes section and included in the calendar invite. These links will expire as configured, preventing the booker from cancelling or rescheduling the meeting.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155028626656/original/zXnX_zWHfeFSujbXsJo_pLkf7ip-kwMigQ8405.png?1719999815\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155028626656\"></p><hr><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-do-bookers-receive-the-cancellation-&amp;-reschedule-link?\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">How do bookers receive the cancellation &amp; reschedule link?</strong></h3><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">When you toggle on \"Allow Cancellation\" and \"Allow Reschedule\", these links are added to the additional notes section. The content in this section is then included in the calendar invite in the notes section. Bookers can use those links to cancel or reschedule their appointments accordingly.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Alternatively, you can use the custom values {{reschedule_link}} and {{cancellation_link}} in your workflows to send out these links to the bookers.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006906-how-to-reschedule-an-email-campaign-email-builder-", "title": "How to Reschedule an Email Campaign (Email Builder)", "folder": "Campaign Settings/Functionalities", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057355426/original/l3sRiHDcmqm4FZ9xB-BN8ojolp_gJpDbFA5679.jpg?1761977531", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057355425/original/WxrDUhXIzC00N6sup1D4JFgiLCHl5We_pg5679.jpg?1761977531"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-1a4b0092-4c8c-475a-8260-6af2104ddf4a\" data-identifyelement=\"509\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\">Rescheduling of Email Campaign is possible for Simple Schedule, Batch Schedule, and <strong data-identifyelement=\"510\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">RSS Schedule one hour (60mins) ahead of the execution date.&nbsp;</strong></div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-8bca771b-a08b-4003-9c15-57e5148b9eb3\" data-identifyelement=\"511\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"512\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-f2648662-463e-4dd3-85f1-288b12e66f33\" data-identifyelement=\"513\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\">The user will be required to visit Marketing &gt; Email. Please visit the Email Campaign tab: it will have a list of Email Campaigns listed with Simple Schedule, RSS Schedule, and Batch Schedule, which can be rescheduled one hour after</div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-f2648662-463e-4dd3-85f1-288b12e66f33\" data-identifyelement=\"514\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\">&nbsp;the execution date/time.</div><h2 data-identifyelement=\"525\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"526\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Steps to Reschedule an Email Campaign</strong></h2><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-0e9b3af7-ea32-42ae-a850-f8b9daa228c1\" data-identifyelement=\"527\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"528\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-445a4fed-de12-4b2c-a640-04e44cc713b1\" data-identifyelement=\"529\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\">1. Under the action button drop-down, select&nbsp;<strong data-identifyelement=\"530\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Reschedule Campaign</strong>.</div><p data-identifyelement=\"531\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"532\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-485c6c67-aa47-496a-abe8-588da01b7a65\" data-identifyelement=\"533\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"></div><p data-identifyelement=\"488\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"489\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"490\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057355426/original/l3sRiHDcmqm4FZ9xB-BN8ojolp_gJpDbFA5679.jpg?1761977531\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155057355426\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"535\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"536\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-445a4fed-de12-4b2c-a640-04e44cc713b1\" data-identifyelement=\"537\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\">2. The user can change the Schedule's details and change the delivery model. Once the changes are done, the user must mark it as the rescheduled campaign to save the settings.</div><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; ove